# Split backend / production builds: set to your API origin + /api suffix (no trailing slash).
# Built into the client at compile time (`npm run build` / Vercel).
# Examples:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://api.your-domain.com/api
#
# Local `npm run dev`: omit this — defaults to `/api` and hits the backend via Vite proxy (vite.config.ts).

# VITE_API_URL=
